        "sentence_id": "8cb5d30ca50402e4c0241cc59fe85cd0",
        "sentence_text": " It is commonly measured as a percentage of the number of encounters in which a patient with a condition received new or increased therapeutic treatment out of the total number of visits to a health care professional by the patient.",
