        "sentence_id": "6a7218ab2d03a003bf8a7fad1c2cd5e9",
        "sentence_text": "Sinoatrial arrest (also known as sinus arrest or sinus pause) is a medical condition wherein the sinoatrial node of the heart transiently ceases to generate the electrical impulses that normally stimulate the myocardial tissues to contract and thus the heart to beat.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 53,
