        "sentence_id": "047bf799ebf1317dec2445037d7cbfad",
        "sentence_text": " Since the heart contains multiple pacemakers, this interruption of the cardiac cycle generally lasts only a few seconds before another part of the heart, such as the atrio-ventricular junction or the ventricles, begins pacing and restores the heart action.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 51,
        "source_order": [
