        "sentence_id": "8a6a6e98840eca4772efc6eef90f61e6",
        "sentence_text": " This condition can be detected on an electrocardiogram (ECG) as a brief period of irregular length with no electrical activity before either the sinoatrial node resumes normal pacing, or another pacemaker begins pacing.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 44,
        "source_order": [
